  "adaptations": [
    "Snow: extract ShaderCanvas setup, uniforms, resize and frame loop verbatim; remove React, app frame bridges and unused background decoding. Preserve 30fps, DPR cap 1.5, staticMode=false and transparent overlay shader. Add error propagation and complete GL cleanup.",
    "Star river: extract StarRiverCanvas fixed-camera mount and unchanged point shaders. Adapt StarRiverParticles to cancel pending cover images on replacement/disposal, preserving Three 0.128 texture defaults and JPEG format selection. Remove React/global compositor bridges; use current.artwork, keep staticMode=false, camera 44deg/16/0.06, DPR cap 1.5 and dt cap 0.08. Add constructor/frame failure cleanup and forceContextLoss. Externalize Three to existing music-visualizers/vendor.",
